# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type }})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

Use it to reference a snapshot Terraform did not take. Declaring such a snapshot as a resource would
hand Terraform ownership of it, and a later destroy would delete the copy it was there to protect.

